  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The pom.xml in ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://github.com/fcrepo4-exts/fcrepo-java-client"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "https://github.com/fcrepo4-exts/fcrepo-java-client",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": " references a fcrepo 5.0.0-SNAPSHOT being on maven. But the SNAPSHOT version of 5.0.0 is not there.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Workaround for the time being is to remove SNAPSHOT where ever fcrepo is referenced in the pom.xml file.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "More details: ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://github.com/fcrepo4-exts/fcrepo-java-client/issues/49"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
