  "description": "<p>The pom.xml in <a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4-exts/fcrepo-java-client\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4-exts/fcrepo-java-client</a> references a fcrepo 5.0.0-SNAPSHOT being on maven. But the SNAPSHOT version of 5.0.0 is not there.</p>\n\n<p>Workaround for the time being is to remove SNAPSHOT where ever fcrepo is referenced in the pom.xml file.</p>\n\n<p>More details: <a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4-exts/fcrepo-java-client/issues/49\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4-exts/fcrepo-java-client/issues/49</a></p>",
